:47:11Z", "user_id": 695524756, "verified_with_instagram": false, "verified_with_tiktok": false, "verified_with_twitter": false, "wallet": "0x8da672e48daa4945b6e0651efdeff5ee96c6a6c6", "waudio_balance": "16700000000", "website": "utube"}, "collaborators": [], "pending_collaborators": [], "access": {"stream": true, "download": true}, "followee_reposts": [], "followee_favorites": [], "remix_of": {"tracks": []}, "stream_conditions": null, "download_conditions": null}, {"track_id": 1678540958, "description": "\ud83c\udfa7 Experience the ultimate late-night vibe with \"Play my pain\" a deep, dark alternative AI R&B track by K \u2013 AI Music. Blending contemporary slow-jam rhythms with heavy 808 bass, this is the perfect midnight soundtrack.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 Welcome to the World of AI Music! \ud83c\udfb6\n\n*Play My Pain* is a captivating AI-generated R&B track that blends soulful vocals, atmospheric soundscapes, and smooth, laid-back rhythms into an emotionally rich listening experience. Combining deep basslines, haunting melodies, and contemporary R&B influences, Play My Pain captures the beauty of heartbreak, vulnerability, and emotions that are too deep to put into words. With its moody late-night vibe and intimate musical atmosphere, the track takes listeners on a journey through inner struggles, hidden feelings, and the healing power of music. Perfect for late-night listening, chill R&B playlists, emotional moods, and nighttime drives, this modern R&B soundscape turns pain into melody, making every note feel like a story waiting to be heard.\n\n\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Created by: K \u2013 AI Music using advanced AI Tools\n\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f Mastered with: BandLab\n\ud83c\udfa5 Visuals powered by: Envato / Pexels\n\n\ud83c\udf05 Sound & Production Style\nThis track features:\n\u2022 Deep alternative R&B basslines\n\u2022 Modern rolling 808 percussion\n\u2022 Hypnotic slow-jam grooves\n\u2022 Dark atmospheric synth pads\n\u2022 Midnight-inspired melodic layers\n\u2022 AI-generated cinematic transitions\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Theme & Concept\nThis music project bridges the gap between technology and emotional R&B culture. It highlights intimate digital fusion, hypnotic soul, and AI-generated sound evolution where artificial intelligence meets modern rhythm.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Perfect For Fans Of:\n\n\u2022 Dark R&B 2026 mixes and atmospheric playlists\n\u2022 Deep slow jam listening sessions\n\u2022 Chill lounge, study, and focus music\n\u2022 Alternative contemporary R&B curation\n\n\ud83d\udd14 Subscribe and turn on notifications to discover the future of alternative AI music.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer: All content is original. Vocals and instrumentation are AI-generated and do not intend to imitate or replicate any real artist. Any resemblance is purely coincidental.\n\n#DarkRnB2026 #AIDarkRnB #AIMusic #AIRnB #AtmosphericRnB #DeepSlowJam #LateNightVibes #AlternativeRnB #KAIMusicACK", "genre": "R&B/Soul", "id": "v6jPvzR", "track_cid": "baeaaaiqsec4pogu5x6lzmnrljjh4ayyxwa5zf4orebdtlerwh4klxo2jr37qi", "preview_cid": null, "orig_file_cid": "baeaaaiqsechan3bbc27rewykewl56oddhlo4ls3fd7yqd3vesnbpwo3v66vag", "orig_filename": "Play my pain S06.wav", "is_original_available": false, "mood": "Romantic", "release_date": "2026-11-05T20:13:23.357062Z", "repost_count": 17, "favorite_count": 16, "comment_count": 0, "tags": "music,aimusic,kaimusic,kaimusicack,rnb,rnbmusic,airnb,airnbmusic,rnbbeat", "title": "Play my pain | K - AI Music [Official AI R&B Music Video]", "slug": "play-my-pain-|-k-ai-music-official-ai-rb-music-video", "duration": 272, "is_downloadable": false, "play_count": 21, "ddex_app": null, "pinned_comment_id": null, "playlists_containing_track": [], "playlists_previously_containing_track":